IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sia-immunity`

-- State Immunity Act 1979, ss 3 to 9, 11, 13 to 16 and 19 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_state-immunity-act-1979.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

